        "text": {
          "elements": [
            {
              "text_run": {
                "content": "The following example lists all backup files in the current organization, as neither project ID nor cluster ID is specified. To view backups for a specific project or cluster, include the corresponding project ID or cluster ID in your request. For details about the RESTful API, see ",
